{"id":"08a9469876bddf9f","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-etale-space-of-germs.md","title":"Definition II.5 Étale Space of Germs","display":"Definition II.5 Étale Space of Germs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-etale-space-of-germs","aliases":["14-df-etale-space-of-germs"],"display":"Definition II.5 Étale Space of Germs","depends_on":["[[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]","[[14-df-stalk-maps]]","[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]"],"source_location":"II.5, printed 84–85, equations (4)–(5); DjVu 48","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-etale-space-of-germs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-etale-space-of-germs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition II.5 Étale Space of Germs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35aa7f1836ebd037\" href=\"?note=35aa7f1836ebd037\" title=\"14-df-stalk-maps\">14-df-stalk-maps</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.5, printed 84–85, equations (4)–(5); DjVu 48"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(P,Q:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 为函子。茎与茎态射见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35aa7f1836ebd037\" href=\"?note=35aa7f1836ebd037\" title=\"14-df-stalk-maps\">14-df-stalk-maps</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:P\\to Q\">\\(h:P\\to Q\\)</span> 为自然变换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_P,p_P,\\widehat s,B_P,\\mathcal B_P,\\sigma_P,\\Lambda_XP\">\\(E_P,p_P,\\widehat s,B_P,\\mathcal B_P,\\sigma_P,\\Lambda_XP\\)</span> 是以下构造；同样以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 为输入定义对应数据。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cont}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cont}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{germ}\">\\(\\mathrm{germ}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a> 中的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_P=\\{(x,a):x\\in X,\\;a\\in P_x\\},\\qquad p_P(x,a)=x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_P=\\{(x,a):x\\in X,\\;a\\in P_x\\},\\qquad p_P(x,a)=x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat s:U\\to E_P,\\quad\\widehat s(x)=(x,\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}s),\\qquad B_P(U,s)=\\widehat s[U]\\quad(U\\in\\tau,\\;s\\in P(U)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat s:U\\to E_P,\\quad\\widehat s(x)=(x,\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}s),\\qquad B_P(U,s)=\\widehat s[U]\\quad(U\\in\\tau,\\;s\\in P(U)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_P=\\{B_P(U,s):U\\in\\tau,\\;s\\in P(U)\\},\\qquad\\sigma_P=\\left\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A:\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal B_P\\right\\},\\qquad\\Lambda_XP=(E_P,\\sigma_P,p_P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B_P=\\{B_P(U,s):U\\in\\tau,\\;s\\in P(U)\\},\\qquad\\sigma_P=\\left\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A:\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal B_P\\right\\},\\qquad\\Lambda_XP=(E_P,\\sigma_P,p_P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_Xh:E_P\\to E_Q,\\qquad\\Lambda_Xh(x,a)=(x,h_x(a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Lambda_Xh:E_P\\to E_Q,\\qquad\\Lambda_Xh(x,a)=(x,h_x(a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cont}(\\Lambda_Xh;E_P,\\sigma_P;E_Q,\\sigma_Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cont}(\\Lambda_Xh;E_P,\\sigma_P;E_Q,\\sigma_Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同点等茎意味着在较小邻域上两截面相等，所以任意两个基本像在交点附近含有第三个基本像；这些像覆盖所有茎。这证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_P\">\\(\\sigma_P\\)</span> 是拓扑，构造没有假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 已经是层。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda h\">\\(\\Lambda h\\)</span> 在每个基本图上把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat s\">\\(\\widehat s\\)</span> 送到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{h_U(s)}\">\\(\\widehat{h_U(s)}\\)</span>，因而连续。用带基点的有序对做不交并，使不同点的茎不会被误认。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-germs-and-stalks","status":"resolved","id":"46dda10bcd4e0ee1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-stalk-maps","status":"resolved","id":"35aa7f1836ebd037","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-stalk-maps]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections","status":"resolved","id":"afeb22707a474889","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-germs-and-stalks","status":"resolved","id":"46dda10bcd4e0ee1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)$，$P,Q:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为函子。茎与茎态射见 [[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]、[[14-df-stalk-maps]]；$h:P\\to Q$ 为自然变换。$E_P,p_P,\\widehat s,B_P,\\mathcal B_P,\\sigma_P,\\Lambda_XP$ 是以下构造；同样以 $Q$ 为输入定义对应数据。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-stalk-maps","status":"resolved","id":"35aa7f1836ebd037","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)$，$P,Q:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为函子。茎与茎态射见 [[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]、[[14-df-stalk-maps]]；$h:P\\to Q$ 为自然变换。$E_P,p_P,\\widehat s,B_P,\\